{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "7a1f0e2b-4c8a-4b3d-9f7d-rabhana-api-v1",
    "name": "Rabhana API",
    "description": "Generated from api/http/routes.go.\n\nVariables:\n- baseUrl: e.g. http://localhost:8080\n- token: JWT access token returned by /auth/login or /auth/verify-otp\n\nAuth: Bearer token on the collection. Public endpoints override to noauth.\n\nGroup prefixes:\n- /api/v1 — public + protected\n- /api/v1/admin — admin-only (JWT + admin claim)\n\nMiddleware tiers:\n- Public: no auth\n- Auth-only: JWT required (banned/suspended users allowed) — currently only /auth/logout\n- Protected: JWT + account status (active) — most endpoints\n- Admin: protected + isAdmin claim",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      { "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
